{
  "id": "RAW_1f31f68a0e",
  "title": "致 HN：我讨厌你们的模糊搜索",
  "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49136990",
  "date": "2026-08-02 02:25:00",
  "author": "Hacker News",
  "siteName": "Hacker News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <center>\n   <table id=\"hnmain\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"85%\" bgcolor=\"#f6f6ef\">\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td bgcolor=\"#ff6600\">\n       <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"padding:2px\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <td style=\"width:18px;padding-right:4px\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/y18.svg\" style=\"border:1px white solid; display:block\"></a></td>\n          <td style=\"line-height:12pt; height:10px;\"><span class=\"pagetop\"><b class=\"hnname\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/news\">Hacker News</a></b><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/newest\">new</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/front\">past</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/newcomments\">comments</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/ask\">ask</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/show\">show</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/jobs\">jobs</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/submit\" rel=\"nofollow\">submit</a></span></td>\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;padding-right:4px;\"><span class=\"pagetop\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/login?goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\">login</a></span></td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr style=\"height:10px\"></tr>\n     <tr id=\"bigbox\">\n      <td>\n       <table class=\"fatitem\" border=\"0\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr class=\"athing submission\" id=\"49136990\">\n          <td align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" class=\"title\"><span class=\"rank\"></span></td>\n          <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n           <center>\n            <a id=\"up_49136990\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49136990&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n           </center>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"title\"><span class=\"titleline\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49136990\">Tell HN: I hate your fuzzy search</a></span></td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td colspan=\"2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"subtext\"><span class=\"subline\"><span class=\"score\" id=\"score_49136990\">30 points</span> by <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=tehwebguy\" class=\"hnuser\">tehwebguy</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:25:00 1785608700\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49136990\">39 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49136990\"></span> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/hide?id=49136990&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\">hide</a> | <a href=\"https://hn.algolia.com/?query=Tell%20HN%3A%20I%20hate%20your%20fuzzy%20search&amp;type=story&amp;dateRange=all&amp;sort=byDate&amp;storyText=false&amp;prefix&amp;page=0\" class=\"hnpast\">past</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/fave?id=49136990&amp;auth=5a220685d8e5be403c9ba67c6c992daa0ad48fd4\">favorite</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49136990\">13&nbsp;comments</a></span></td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td colspan=\"2\"></td>\n          <td>\n           <div class=\"toptext\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">\n            Not just HN the site, everyone’s fuzzy search sucks. Let me do exact match search. Even if it’s an option I have to dig deep to find.\n            <p>When I ran a site that had lots of search use I <i>agonized</i> over making search good and never nuked exact match for the sake of some fuzzy matching. I wish others would do the same.</p>\n           </div>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr style=\"height:6px\"></tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td colspan=\"2\"></td>\n          <td>\n           <form action=\"comment\" method=\"post\">\n            <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"parent\" value=\"49136990\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"goto\" value=\"item?id=49136990\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hmac\" value=\"eae660b1a108eaa68be82ca8a856e6b22fe4465c\"><textarea name=\"text\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"80\" wrap=\"virtual\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom\"></textarea>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/formatdoc\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span size=\"-2\" color=\"#AFAFAF\">help</span></a>\n            <br>\n            <br>\n            <input type=\"submit\" value=\"add comment\">\n           </form>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n       <br>\n       <table border=\"0\" class=\"comment-tree\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137144\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137144\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137144&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mmargenot\" class=\"hnuser\">mmargenot</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:43:30 1785609810\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137144\">21 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137144\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Gmail's search on mobile, where things come up in the quick results only to disappear when I complete the search, is a millstone about my neck.</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137144&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137144\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137310\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"1\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137310\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137310&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mrngm\" class=\"hnuser\">mrngm</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:58:23 1785610703\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137310\">6 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137310\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Asana has the same problem. Really frustrating.</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137310&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137310\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137357\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137357\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137357&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=aeagentic\" class=\"hnuser\">aeagentic</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T19:04:28 1785611068\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137357\">0 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137357\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Best search is windows where u get trash can Onlineshop when u look for the trash and terminal the movie if u look for the terminal</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137357&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137357\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137131\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137131\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137131&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=tetris11\" class=\"hnuser\">tetris11</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:41:35 1785609695\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137131\">23 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137131\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Quotes should be enough to trigger an exact search. How we regressed from this is beyond me</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137131&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137131\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137168\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"1\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137168\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137168&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mikewarot\" class=\"hnuser\">mikewarot</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:45:33 1785609933\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137168\">19 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137168\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Strong agree... now if only there were a way to specify \"text\" followed by a non-character. Some words I need to find turn out to be prefixes. 8(</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137168&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137168\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137174\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137174\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137174&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=archonis\" class=\"hnuser\">archonis</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:46:06 1785609966\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137174\">18 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137174\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">\n                 Exact match results followed by fuzzy match would cover most use cases, and clear toggles would cover the remaing ones.\n                 <p>It boggles the mind why this particular wheel keeps getting reinvented in octoganal shapes.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137174&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137174\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137252\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137252\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137252&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=leros\" class=\"hnuser\">leros</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:53:28 1785610408\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137252\">11 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137252\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">\n                 HackerNews search respects double quotes around your terms as an exact match, as do many other search engines.\n                 <p>For example search for \"Amerca\" with and without quotes. Without quotes you get content for \"America\" but with quotes you only get the exact typo match.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137252&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137252\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137178\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137178\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137178&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=lukan\" class=\"hnuser\">lukan</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:46:24 1785609984\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137178\">18 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137178\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Spotify's fuzzy search makes me want to do pirating again. Looking for a non mainstream artist can be really hard at times for no good reason than to appeal to the dumb average user. I even tried to build my own spotify player and going over the API - same shit (allmost).</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137178&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137178\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137360\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137360\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137360&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=soupspaces\" class=\"hnuser\">soupspaces</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T19:04:49 1785611089\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137360\">0 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137360\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">\n                 script for finding GH links ranked\n                 <p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/hundredwatt/183191d02f1fe0db31c3e910fff8adda\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gist.github.com/hundredwatt/183191d02f1fe0db31c3e910...</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137360&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137360\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137118\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"0\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137118\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137118&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=bawolff\" class=\"hnuser\">bawolff</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:40:31 1785609631\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137118\">24 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137118\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">\n                 &gt; Not just HN\n                 <p>Umm, does HN even have a search?</p>\n                 <p>Almost every site i've ever used the search of supported exact matches by putting the query in quote marks.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137118&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137118\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137127\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"1\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137127\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137127&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=mplanchard\" class=\"hnuser\">mplanchard</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:41:17 1785609677\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137127\">23 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137127\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">Search input box is at the bottom, yes</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137127&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137127\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137135\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"2\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137135\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137135&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=bawolff\" class=\"hnuser\">bawolff</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:42:21 1785609741\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137135\">22 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137135\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">\n                 Oh wow. Never noticed that before. Guess im blind.\n                 <p>Although when i tested it just now it did seem to support exact matches using quotes.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137135&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137135\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr class=\"athing comtr\" id=\"49137141\">\n          <td>\n           <table border=\"0\">\n            <tbody>\n             <tr>\n              <td class=\"ind\" indent=\"2\"><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\"></td>\n              <td valign=\"top\" class=\"votelinks\">\n               <center>\n                <a id=\"up_49137141\" href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/vote?id=49137141&amp;how=up&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990\"></a>\n               </center>\n              </td>\n              <td class=\"default\">\n               <div style=\"margin-top:2px; margin-bottom:-10px;\">\n                <span class=\"comhead\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=bdangubic\" class=\"hnuser\">bdangubic</a> <span class=\"age\" title=\"2026-08-01T18:42:52 1785609772\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49137141\">22 minutes ago</a></span> <span id=\"unv_49137141\"></span><span class=\"navs\"> | | | [–]<span class=\"onstory\"></span></span></span>\n               </div>\n               <br>\n               <div class=\"comment\">\n                <div class=\"commtext c00\">absolute marvel of design. it is exactly where it should be!</div>\n                <div class=\"reply\">\n                 <p><span size=\"1\"><u><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/reply?id=49137141&amp;goto=item%3Fid%3D49136990%2349137141\" rel=\"nofollow\">reply</a></u></span></p>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n       <br>\n       <br>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><img src=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/s.gif\">\n       <table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <td bgcolor=\"#ff6600\"></td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n       <br>\n       <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/apply/\">Consider applying for YC's Fall 2026 batch! <u>Applications</u> are open till July 27.</a>\n       </center>\n       <br>\n       <center>\n        <span class=\"yclinks\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/newsguidelines.html\">Guidelines</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/newsfaq.html\">FAQ</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/lists\">Lists</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/HackerNews/API\">API</a> | <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/security.html\">Security</a> | <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/legal/\">Legal</a> | <a href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com/apply/\">Apply to YC</a> | <a href=\"mailto:hn@ycombinator.com\">Contact</a></span>\n        <br>\n        <br>\n        <form method=\"get\" action=\"//hn.algolia.com/\">\n         Search: <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" size=\"17\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        </form>\n       </center></td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </center>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "作者批评了模糊搜索实现的现状，认为它们设计不佳，无法提供准确的结果。",
